      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:不管是谁，只要做了一件真正的好事，]@[textBlack:那就是至高无上的幸福了吧。]@[textBlack:所以，我觉得我妈妈一定会原谅我的。]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "left",
        "narrationPosX": 180
      },
      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:（翻页）]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "center",
        "narrationPosX": 0
      },
      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:但是我又想到，]@[textBlack:与其要做到这一步来拯救这两个孩子，]@[textBlack:还是和他们一起去上帝的面前]@[textBlack:才能使他们获得真正的幸福。]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "left",
        "narrationPosX": 180
      },
      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:（翻页）]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "center",
        "narrationPosX": 0
      },
      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:不管是多么令人痛苦的事，]@[textBlack:只要是走在正确的道路上，@不管是上高山还是下陡坡，]@[textBlack:都是在一步步接近真正的幸福。]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "left",
        "narrationPosX": 180
      },
      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:（翻页）]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "center",
        "narrationPosX": 0
      },
      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:为了获得唯一的至高幸福，]@[textBlack:就必须饱尝各种悲苦，这也是上帝的旨意。]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "left",
        "narrationPosX": 180
      },
      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:（翻页）]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "center",
        "narrationPosX": 0
      },
      {
        "narration": "[textBlack:我已经决定了要像那只天蝎一样，]@[textBlack:只要是为了大家真正的幸福，]@[textBlack:就算灼烧我的身体百遍也在所不惜。]",
        "narrationHAlignment": "left",
